---
const ja = Astro.props.lang === 'ja';
---
<section class="v3-mcp" aria-labelledby="mcp-title">
  <div class="v3-section-heading"><div><span class="v3-status">{ja ? '用途の構成案 · MCP連携は未検証' : 'Architecture candidate · MCP integration unverified'}</span><h2 id="mcp-title" set:html={ja ? '検索と重い文書処理を、<wbr>別の処理先へ。' : 'Keep search and heavy document work on separate backends.'} /></div><p>{ja ? 'MCPサービスにも、同じ入口の奥で処理先を選ぶ使い方を検討できます。利用者の接続設定を増やさず、検索と原本処理を別のバックエンドへ振り分ける構成案です。' : 'The same routing approach can sit in front of an MCP service. Keep one client endpoint while directing search and source-document processing to separate backends.'}</p></div>
  <figure class="mcp-map" aria-label={ja ? '未検証の構成案。一つのMCP URLからRubyの規則を経て、検索または文書処理へ振り分ける。' : 'Unverified architecture candidate: one MCP URL, Ruby routing rules, then search or document processing.'}><div class="mcp-entry"><strong>MCP URL</strong><span class="mcp-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span></div><div class="mcp-rules"><strong>{ja ? 'Rubyの振分規則' : 'Ruby routing rules'}</strong><span class="mcp-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span></div><div class="mcp-targets"><span>{ja ? '検索' : 'Search'}</span><span>{ja ? '文書・原本処理' : 'Documents / source files'}</span></div><figcaption>{ja ? '認可・discovery・プロトコル検証はMCPサービスが担います。ngx_mrubyはHTTPの前段に置くモジュールです。' : 'Authorization, discovery and protocol validation remain the service’s responsibility. ngx_mruby itself is not an MCP server.'}</figcaption></figure>
  <a class="section-link" href={ja ? '/ja/guides/mcp-gateway/' : '/guides/mcp-gateway/'}>{ja ? '構成の考え方と制約を読む →' : 'Read the design and its boundaries →'}</a>
</section>
